1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Choosing an AI model for government use takes more than comparing answers.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Teams must assess performance, security, privacy, and applicable
requirements.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:20,000
When tests and supporting documents are scattered, evaluation becomes harder
to coordinate, review, and repeat.

4
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
AIGov Compass brings this process into one structured workflow.

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:40,000
It helps government teams define their use case, compare model candidates,
review evaluation evidence, and document a human decision.

6
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:49,000
The journey starts with the intended use case and its requirements.

7
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Reviewers then compare candidates and inspect test results.

8
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Each result shows its evaluation method and limitations, helping reviewers
understand what the evidence supports - and what still needs investigation.

9
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:13,000
Our key distinction is the evidence gate.

10
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:18,000
Strong performance alone does not make a model ready for deployment.

11
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:24,000
If a mandatory requirement lacks supporting evidence, approval is blocked.

12
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:29,000
The platform explains the gap and the next action required.

13
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:34,000
An authorized human reviewer remains responsible for the final decision.

14
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:49,000
The model passport records the evaluated use case, model information,
results, evidence gaps, and reviewer decision.

15
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:58,000
When the model version changes, the prototype requests reassessment while
preserving the previous decision as a historical record.

16
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:04,000
We target an 80 percent reduction in evaluation time.

17
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:12,000
This remains a goal to validate through equivalent manual and
platform-assisted tasks, including human review.

18
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:22,000
Our proposed 90-day roadmap covers requirement validation, a limited pilot,
and improvements based on measured results.

19
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:32,000
AIGov Compass: choose the right model, see the evidence, and keep humans in
control.
